 Laurie Stone, “PJM’s Speed to Power Problem and How to Fix It,” RMI, November 4, 2025, https://rmi.org/pjms-
speed-to-power-problem-and-how-to-fix-it/. 
42
 “Interview #15,” (Virtual meeting room), February 2026. 
