Developers disputed RRI's cost impact. The Keystone Energy Efficiency Alliance and 
the Energy Efficiency Alliance of New Jersey jointly protested that RRI "jeopardizes 
the viability of existing late-stage TC2 projects that have adhered to PJM Tariff 
