Dissolving uncertainties for decision-making 
FERC found the policies reasonable in principle, deferring the specifics to the RTOs. 
The uncertainties of forecasting reliability needs were broadly acknowledged by 
stakeholders. MISO addressed them directly in its answer: 
“The challenges posed by this situation are broadly recognized and do not depend 
on the specific findings of only one study. A challenging aspect of spot load 
 
